translation:
{cmd:7F0900000F}I've only just
worked it out.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}People give courtesy
chocolates on Valentine's
Day{cmd:7F0308} because they expect
gifts back on White Day!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}As for me,{cmd:7F0308}
I get all sorts of gifts
without having to do
anything at all.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}So I never{cmd:7F0308} even{cmd:7F0308}
noticed,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}When May comes around,{cmd:7F0308}
we put up carp streamers
all over town, don't we?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000B}{cmd:7F030A}Wait...{cmd:7F030F}
Do we say we put up
carp streamers?{cmd:7F0308}
Or display them?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000F}Make them climb{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F030F}
No, that can't be right.{cmd:7F030F}
Make them swim, perhaps?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000016}
{cmd:7F02}Hey, {cmd:7F1A}!{cmd:7F0308}
Make up your mind!{cmd:7F030F}
How irresponsible!{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Lunar month nine, day 13{cmd:7F0306}
is Thirteenth Night.{cmd:7F04}
True moon-viewing fans go
then too,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Of course, I'm a true fan,{cmd:7F0308}
so I'll be by the pond
admiring the moon,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}In case you don't know,
I'll tell you the date.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}This year's 13th day
of lunar month nine{cmd:7F0308}
falls on{cmd:7F0304} {cmd:7F3E} {cmd:7F3F},{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F0C050001}{cmd:7F09000015}Hmhm.{cmd:7F0306}
It's sweet of you to listen.{cmd:7F0308}
I'll tell you,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}In the fishing tourney,{cmd:7F0308}
records are set by the size
of the black bass you catch.
{cmd:7F0900000B}You know that, right?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}But did you know{cmd:7F0308}
you can judge a black bass's
size just by looking
at it{cmd:7F0308}?
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}You're clever,
{cmd:7F1A}.
You've worked it out,
haven't you?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Just because you catch one,{cmd:7F0308}
don't rush to show it
to the person in charge!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}That's the trick,{cmd:7F0308}
so go and win yourself
plenty of prizes,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}When it's raining,{cmd:7F0304}
you could at least stay
quietly at home,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0C090003}Spend some time{cmd:7F0304}
reading {cmd:7F33}
or something else{cmd:7F0304} in print.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}It's important to learn
a little, too,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

For now,{cmd:7F0304} I've made it
yellow-green.{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F09000012}{cmd:7F0305}I had some paint left over,{cmd:7F0305}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F0C000004}
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000001}What{cmd:7F0302} do you{cmd:7F0306} mean,{cmd:7F0304}
"slightly dissatisfied"{cmd:7F0306}?!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000005}
{cmd:7F02}It's because you don't
make an effort{cmd:7F0308} that
{cmd:7F2F}
is in this state!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000016}
{cmd:7F02}Pull yourself together!{cmd:7F0308}
Think of me! I've lived
here all this time!{cmd:7F09000001}{cmd:7F0304} Honestly!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!!
{cmd:7F00}

Welcome!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Your house renovations
are finished!
You've had a look, yes?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}The room is so spacious
now,{cmd:7F0308} you can fit
all sorts of furniture
in there!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Now then,{cmd:7F0304}
the renovation fee{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F0302}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}That will be
498,000 Bells, please!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000004}{cmd:7F0305}Oh, I'm sure you know,{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F090000FF}
but you don't have to
pay it all right now.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Please send your payments
through the {cmd:7F504BA0000B}post office.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}And,{cmd:7F030C}
just to be certain,
let me remind you...{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Your house can't get{cmd:7F0306}
any bigger than this.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Even so,{cmd:7F0306} you still
have to pay{cmd:7F0308}
for what you've bought.
In full,{cmd:7F0304} yes?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}That's how{cmd:7F0304}
society works,{cmd:7F0304} hm?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}In any case,{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F09000015}
I look forward to your
continued patronage!
{cmd:7F00}
